\section{Reproducibility}{

\code{\link[=run_simulation]{run_simulation()}} pins the L'Ecuyer-CMRG generator and gives each
replicate its own substream via \code{\link[=sim_streams]{sim_streams()}}, capturing the
state so that any single replicate can be re-executed in isolation
with \code{\link[=with_rng_state]{with_rng_state()}}. The RNG kind and seed of the calling
session are restored on exit.
}

